    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d22-a4">

                <pb facs="0122" n="26" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg26"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 77.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Tower to Mr.
                            Meller.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-29"><hi rendition="#italic">April 29,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Sir: I have received your letter of the 27th of April, and I have taken steps
                    toward your relief. I wrote to the bezirkshauptmann at Lemberg on the 27th of
                    April, immediately after receiving your telegram, and expect to hear from him
                    soon in reply. You may be confident that I shall not lose sight of your
                    case.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Charlemagne Tower.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
